{"id":"916ea8724331b0a4","group":"67","path":"67/67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration.md","title":"Consistent Numeration Characterization","display":"cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration — Consistent Numeration Characterization","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration","aliases":["67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration"],"display":"cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration — Consistent Numeration Characterization","depends_on":["[[67-df-interpretability]]","[[67-df-numeration]]","[[67-df-formula-provability]]","[[67-lem-orey-hajek]]","[[67-thm-arithmetized-completeness]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，Corollary 2，印刷页 80；PDF 第 91 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"已核对陈述和由 Lemmas 2–3、Theorem 4 的推导；保留算术化完备性草图限制","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration — Consistent Numeration Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2048e5139e9d29b\" href=\"?note=f2048e5139e9d29b\" title=\"67-lem-orey-hajek\">67-lem-orey-hajek</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"422d9b41ae960a38\" href=\"?note=422d9b41ae960a38\" title=\"67-thm-arithmetized-completeness\">67-thm-arithmetized-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，Corollary 2，印刷页 80；PDF 第 91 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"已核对陈述和由 Lemmas 2–3、Theorem 4 的推导；保留算术化完备性草图限制"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致、原始递归公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>；采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f2048e5139e9d29b\" href=\"?note=f2048e5139e9d29b\" title=\"67-lem-orey-hajek\">67-lem-orey-hajek</a> 的标准编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g[S]\">\\(g[S]\\)</span> 是源公理代码集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 遍历至多自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 的算术公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{Binum}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{Binum}_T\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nS\\unlhd T\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\sigma,g[S])\\land T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\sigma,g[S])\\land T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nS\\unlhd T\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\sigma,g[S])\\land T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\sigma,g[S])\\land T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd T\">\\(S\\unlhd T\\)</span> 出发，Orey–Hájek 给每个有限片段的一致性可证；Lemma 3 将原 PR 双表示改为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^*(z)=\\sigma(z)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma\\upharpoonright z}\">\\(\\sigma^*(z)=\\sigma(z)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma\\upharpoonright z}\\)</span>，得到仍双表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 且 PA 可证一致的呈示。反向用算术化完备性即可。</p>\n<p>量词中的表示公式可以随理论对改变；本结论不说任取一个标准公理表示都能在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中证明其一致性。一般情况下，这一存在性条件也不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_S\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_S\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，用户提供的 Cambridge/ASL 2016 重印本 PDF；第 6 章 §1，Corollary 2，印刷页 80；PDF 第 91 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已核对陈述和由 Lemmas 2–3、Theorem 4 的推导；保留算术化完备性草图限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"9c200c8ec3685766","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-numeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-lem-orey-hajek","status":"resolved","id":"f2048e5139e9d29b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-lem-orey-hajek]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-arithmetized-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"422d9b41ae960a38","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-arithmetized-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-lem-orey-hajek","status":"resolved","id":"f2048e5139e9d29b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是一致、原始递归公理集，$\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T$；采用 [[67-lem-orey-hajek]] 的标准编码。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"9c200c8ec3685766","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g[S]$ 是源公理代码集；$\\sigma$ 遍历至多自由变量 $z$ 的算术公式。$\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{Binum}_T$ 取 [[67-df-numeration]]，$\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma$ 取 [[67-df-formula-provability]]，$\\unlhd$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g[S]$ 是源公理代码集；$\\sigma$ 遍历至多自由变量 $z$ 的算术公式。$\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{Binum}_T$ 取 [[67-df-numeration]]，$\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma$ 取 [[67-df-formula-provability]]，$\\unlhd$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g[S]$ 是源公理代码集；$\\sigma$ 遍历至多自由变量 $z$ 的算术公式。$\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{Binum}_T$ 取 [[67-df-numeration]]，$\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma$ 取 [[67-df-formula-provability]]，$\\unlhd$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"g[S]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{Binum}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nS\\unlhd T\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\sigma,g[S])\\land T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\sigma,g[S])\\land T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S\\unlhd T","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma^*(z)=\\sigma(z)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma\\upharpoonright z}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_S","display":false}],"bytes":2380,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5c44edc6c37ffdc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-relative-interpretation]]；[[../67-df-faithful-interpretability]]；[[../67-lem-orey-hajek]]；[[../67-thm-orey-compactness]]；[[../67-thm-interpretability-pi1]]；[[../67-df-formula-provability]]；[[../67-thm-arithmetized-completeness]]；[[../67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration]]；[[../67-thm-faithful-interpretability-criterion]]"}],"outgoing":["44cd21d3d12e4d8d","9c200c8ec3685766","1e05755479add015","f2048e5139e9d29b","422d9b41ae960a38"]}